// Integrated Test Framework UX 2.0 (`axiomc test`), Isolated Test Executables,
// Build-Feature Semantic Invariance, Verified-MIR Differential Execution Harness,
// Target-Independent Semantic Debug Model, Logical Inlined Frames, `OptimizedOut`
// Honesty & Zero-Cost Disabled Tracing Auditor (T818 / E19.5).
// Implements SPEC-104 §§3, 4, 6, 7 (AXS-TST-001..004, AXS-TST-010..012,
// AXS-TST-030..035, AXS-TST-050..053; REQ-TOOL-002, REQ-TOOL-003, REQ-TOOL-005..011,
// REQ-TOOL-179, REQ-TST-112; INV-TST-001).
